	$E_{x_1} = E_1^1 \subsetneq E_1^2 \subsetneq 0$ with weights $\alpha_1^1
	= 1/3, \alpha_1^2 = 2/3$ and parabolic structure at $x_2$ given by $E_{x_2} = E_2^1 \subsetneq 0$ with weight
	$\alpha_2^1 = 1/2$.

